      "id": "aapl-risk-suppliers",
      "type": "narrative",
      "answer": "Apple outlines risks related to outsourcing partners and single-source suppliers in its 2025 10-K filing. These include reduced control over production, supply shortages, quality issues, and pricing risks. Reliance on single-source suppliers and industry-wide shortages, such as semiconductor shortages, has historically disrupted supply chains, impacting operations and financials. The company also faces risks from logistics disruptions and potential unanticipated product defect liabilities.",
